WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:58.195
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:58.465 --> 02:01.225
Students, contemplate this.

3
02:01.305 --> 02:05.065
When you encounter terrible weather like we have today,

4
02:05.145 --> 02:09.385
do you feel gloomy,

5
02:09.465 --> 02:12.625
or glad that you brought an umbrella?

6
02:12.705 --> 02:14.345
When you go to cross the street

7
02:14.425 --> 02:16.905
and the light suddenly turns red,

8
02:16.985 --> 02:18.585
do you feel unlucky--

9
02:18.665 --> 02:20.105
Excuse me.

10
02:24.905 --> 02:27.025
MENTAL HEALTH LECTURE

11
02:30.465 --> 02:32.265
Do you feel unlucky?

12
02:32.345 --> 02:35.905
-Or glad that you can rest for a bit? -My package.

13
02:35.985 --> 02:39.505
Whether someone feels happiness

14
02:39.585 --> 02:43.065
depends on their perspective of the world.

15
02:43.985 --> 02:45.425
It's not an abstract theory.

16
02:45.505 --> 02:48.865
In psychology, there is a very realistic view.

17
02:48.945 --> 02:51.225
An event itself isn't inherently good or bad.

18
02:51.305 --> 02:52.705
This is Guo Xiao's.

19
02:52.785 --> 02:53.705
Some students

20
02:54.305 --> 02:56.065
don't take this lecture seriously.

21
02:56.145 --> 02:58.025
They show up when it's almost over.

22
02:59.145 --> 03:00.185
It's understandable.

23
03:00.265 --> 03:02.745
There are no credits for this lecture.

24
03:02.825 --> 03:04.385
Next time,

25
03:04.465 --> 03:08.465
I should apply to the college for a mental health credit.

26
03:09.785 --> 03:10.905
No.

27
03:10.985 --> 03:12.505
No!

28
03:12.585 --> 03:13.945
All right.

29
03:14.545 --> 03:16.385
Settle down. Let's get back on track.

30
03:16.465 --> 03:17.865
DELIVERY AND ERRANDS ON-CAMPUS ONLY

31
03:17.945 --> 03:19.665
Guo Xiao. Here.

32
03:19.745 --> 03:21.745
RED PACKETS RECEIVED

33
03:21.825 --> 03:22.865
Zheng Yu.

34
03:24.105 --> 03:25.025
Zheng Yu!

35
03:25.785 --> 03:27.785
You're walking so fast. Feeling guilty?

36
03:30.505 --> 03:31.945
What is it?

37
03:34.185 --> 03:35.145
Did you drop this?

38
03:35.225 --> 03:36.665
It has a crack.

39
03:40.385 --> 03:43.065
I did trip and fall, but the package was in my bag.

40
03:43.665 --> 03:45.465
It didn't touch the ground.

41
03:46.225 --> 03:48.465
And there is cushioning in the box.

42
03:48.545 --> 03:50.985
This scratch doesn't seem to be from the fall.

43
03:51.065 --> 03:53.385
What do you mean by that?

44
03:53.465 --> 03:56.065
What I mean is maybe it was the seller's fault.

45
03:56.145 --> 03:58.065
The perfume cost 1,000 yuan.

46
03:58.145 --> 03:59.785
Are you claiming it's defective?

47
03:59.865 --> 04:01.585
I called the seller right away.

48
04:01.665 --> 04:03.785
They sent me a video of it being packaged.

49
04:03.865 --> 04:05.745
The courier sent me a CCTV screenshot.

50
04:05.825 --> 04:06.945
Look.

51
04:11.225 --> 04:13.025
State your price for compensation.

52
04:13.105 --> 04:15.105
What? You should pay the full price.

53
04:16.184 --> 04:18.465
This perfume can still be used.

54
04:18.545 --> 04:20.785
I bought it as a gift for a friend.

55
04:20.865 --> 04:23.145
I can't give them a defective product.

56
04:24.185 --> 04:26.185
Here's what we'll do. I'll give you the perfume.

57
04:26.265 --> 04:27.505
Pay the full 1,000 yuan.

58
04:29.505 --> 04:31.305
I don't have 1,000 yuan right now.

59
04:31.385 --> 04:33.225
I'll give it to you as soon as I do.

60
04:35.025 --> 04:36.705
Then give me an IOU.

61
04:37.385 --> 04:38.225
Take the box.

62
04:48.705 --> 04:49.945
Never mind.

63
04:50.025 --> 04:52.185
That's all. You can't renege anyway.

64
05:05.585 --> 05:07.345
DR. ZHAO

65
05:11.825 --> 05:12.705
Hello?

66
05:14.425 --> 05:16.225
Your mom had a fever for a few days.

67
05:16.305 --> 05:18.665
After treatment, her temperature has come down.

68
05:18.745 --> 05:22.145
But there could be complications from the prolonged coma.

69
05:22.225 --> 05:24.465
Further medication will be needed.

70
05:24.545 --> 05:26.145
The fees have to be paid first.

71
05:26.225 --> 05:28.265
The nursing fees have already been discounted

72
05:28.345 --> 05:29.825
in accordance with hospital policy.

73
05:29.905 --> 05:31.905
If payment continues to be delayed…

74
06:17.425 --> 06:18.705
NOTICE OF HOSPITAL CHARGES

75
06:20.305 --> 06:22.785
I heard the daughter of the woman in Bed 2 is unreachable.

76
06:22.865 --> 06:25.025
She owes a huge bill. Is that true?

77
06:25.865 --> 06:28.945
Ms. Xue, where did you hear that?

78
06:31.705 --> 06:33.585
The woman in Bed 2 is so unlucky.

79
06:33.665 --> 06:35.265
Her son and daughter were fine,

80
06:35.345 --> 06:37.505
visiting often to keep her company.

81
06:37.585 --> 06:39.825
But after their uncle caused a scene here,

82
06:39.905 --> 06:41.625
the son never returned.

83
06:42.225 --> 06:43.505
That makes sense.

84
06:43.585 --> 06:45.465
The boy was adopted by the uncle.

85
06:45.545 --> 06:47.785
Why would he care for his sick mother?

86
06:47.865 --> 06:50.545
Goodness gracious, even her daughter has left her.

87
06:50.625 --> 06:53.105
Ms. Xue, how can you say that?

88
06:53.185 --> 06:55.265
Is Xiaozheng that kind of person?

89
06:55.825 --> 06:58.345
Everyone encounters difficulties at some point.

90
06:58.425 --> 07:02.185
Saying this behind her back isn't right.

91
07:02.265 --> 07:04.305
How long has it been since she last came?

92
07:04.385 --> 07:06.145
It's not like I'm wrong.

93
07:07.065 --> 07:08.385
Xiaowu,

94
07:08.465 --> 07:10.065
how much does Xiaozheng owe?

95
07:10.665 --> 07:12.025
I wouldn't know, Ms. Yang.

96
07:21.785 --> 07:24.465
I remember Xiaoliu told me the bill was left here.

97
07:24.545 --> 07:26.105
I don't see it here.

98
07:26.985 --> 07:28.265
Wait here for now.

99
07:32.225 --> 07:33.865
Xiaowu, come take a look.

100
07:33.945 --> 07:35.745
My mom seems a bit feverish.

101
07:35.825 --> 07:38.265
-Is she? -It's like Ms. Xue's husband.

102
07:38.345 --> 07:40.465
He had the same rash last time.

103
07:40.545 --> 07:41.465
Take a look.

104
07:41.545 --> 07:42.385
There isn't one.

105
07:42.465 --> 07:43.745
She has a rash.

106
07:43.825 --> 07:44.665
Do you see it?

107
07:44.745 --> 07:45.585
That red rash.

108
07:45.665 --> 07:47.465
Could it be from the heat?

109
07:47.545 --> 07:48.425
Air out the room.

110
07:48.505 --> 07:50.465
Is it from the heat?

111
07:55.025 --> 07:56.065
Excuse me.

112
08:05.065 --> 08:07.025
There is a saying I've heard.

113
08:07.105 --> 08:08.825
You can judge a person by their shoes.

114
08:09.785 --> 08:12.585
Different shoes take people down different paths.

115
08:13.705 --> 08:15.985
Only the shoes on a rainy day are an exception.

116
08:16.625 --> 08:19.905
They bring everyone to a state of equal disarray.

117
08:20.625 --> 08:23.865
It makes me feel like I am no different from them.

118
08:54.825 --> 08:56.665
Excuse me.

119
08:58.785 --> 08:59.665
Thank you.

120
09:27.345 --> 09:30.225
The treatment for myocarditis is a very long process.

121
09:31.145 --> 09:32.745
Your overall recovery is good.

122
09:33.345 --> 09:35.545
But just in case, you need regular checkups.

123
09:35.625 --> 09:37.185
Like I always say,

124
09:37.265 --> 09:39.945
exercise moderately, eat healthy, and rest well.

125
09:40.025 --> 09:42.145
If you ever feel tired, just rest.

126
09:43.185 --> 09:44.425
Take care of your heart.

127
09:45.065 --> 09:45.985
Thank you, Doctor.

128
09:47.985 --> 09:49.105
Don't forget your ID.

129
10:05.385 --> 10:06.505
My wallet.

130
10:30.105 --> 10:31.105
It looks like this.

131
10:31.185 --> 10:34.345
It has some cash and a few bank cards.

132
10:34.425 --> 10:35.265
I haven't seen it.

133
10:35.345 --> 10:38.465
These are all lost-and-found items. You can see if it's here.

134
10:39.825 --> 10:42.505
LOST AND FOUND

135
10:45.785 --> 10:49.105
Why don't I make a lost-and-found notice in our group chat?

136
10:49.185 --> 10:50.345
Many people use it,

137
10:50.425 --> 10:52.545
like doctors, nurses, and relatives of patients.

138
10:52.625 --> 10:54.425
Maybe someone has information.

139
10:54.505 --> 10:55.345
Okay.

140
10:55.425 --> 10:56.785
What is your last name?

141
10:56.865 --> 10:58.385
Chen, C-H-E-N.

142
10:59.505 --> 11:00.785
Can I add something?

143
11:00.865 --> 11:02.465
If anyone finds and returns it,

144
11:02.545 --> 11:04.625
I will offer a 1,000-yuan reward as thanks.

145
11:04.705 --> 11:05.985
One thousand yuan?

146
11:06.065 --> 11:07.665
Is the wallet that valuable?

147
11:08.385 --> 11:10.865
Here, take a look. Is this okay?

148
11:10.945 --> 11:13.745
-I will also need your phone number. -Okay.

149
11:13.825 --> 11:18.225
If the lost item is very valuable, I suggest you go to the police.

150
11:18.305 --> 11:21.305
Then you will have the right to see the security footage,

151
11:21.385 --> 11:22.825
increasing your chances.

152
11:23.425 --> 11:25.065
Okay, I see.

153
11:25.145 --> 11:26.145
Thank you.

154
11:44.025 --> 11:45.105
Is this your wallet?

155
11:47.385 --> 11:48.425
Yes.

156
11:59.185 --> 12:00.385
Where did you find it?

157
12:01.185 --> 12:02.305
In the elevator.

158
12:13.745 --> 12:14.945
Thank you.

159
12:23.665 --> 12:24.945
I've returned the wallet.

160
12:25.025 --> 12:27.905
Please pay out the 1,000 yuan.

161
12:33.145 --> 12:35.105
What is the account number and name?

162
12:35.185 --> 12:36.305
I'll send it to you.

163
12:36.385 --> 12:37.545
I want cash.

164
12:41.625 --> 12:42.665
Sure.

165
12:56.265 --> 12:57.985
Hello. I found my wallet.

166
12:58.065 --> 13:00.145
Please update the post.

167
13:01.625 --> 13:04.105
Do you know that girl?

168
13:04.865 --> 13:08.265
No. She saw the post and returned the wallet.

169
13:09.025 --> 13:10.705
It's a bit strange.

170
13:11.945 --> 13:13.625
I could just be being paranoid,

171
13:13.705 --> 13:17.665
but that girl was sitting in that seating area all afternoon.

172
13:18.185 --> 13:19.305
In the beginning,

173
13:19.385 --> 13:20.585
I didn't pay attention.

174
13:20.665 --> 13:23.545
I thought she was waiting for someone or for lab results.

175
13:23.625 --> 13:25.945
After a few hours, I looked up,

176
13:26.025 --> 13:28.385
and she was still sitting there, unmoving,

177
13:28.465 --> 13:29.665
just watching this desk.

178
13:30.185 --> 13:31.625
Now that I think about it,

179
13:31.705 --> 13:33.505
if she found the wallet,

180
13:33.585 --> 13:35.185
she could have brought it here.

181
13:35.265 --> 13:37.745
The words "Lost and Found" are clear to see.

182
13:38.385 --> 13:39.745
Why wait all afternoon?

183
13:39.825 --> 13:42.865
So is it possible that she was waiting for you?

184
13:42.945 --> 13:45.425
Even without the post in the group chat,

185
13:45.505 --> 13:47.625
she may have wanted to extort you.

186
13:47.705 --> 13:50.945
Do you want the police to investigate this incident?

187
13:53.465 --> 13:54.385
Forget it.

188
13:55.025 --> 13:57.145
There's no need to waste time on this.

189
13:58.065 --> 13:59.105
Thank you.

190
14:16.345 --> 14:17.225
Unlocked.

191
14:37.785 --> 14:39.065
Ms. Zhou,

192
14:39.145 --> 14:40.385
are you playing Werewolf?

193
14:40.465 --> 14:41.905
Night falls. Close your eyes.

194
14:41.985 --> 14:43.025
No.

195
14:43.105 --> 14:45.545
The power tripped. Your dad is in the garage fixing it.

196
14:46.785 --> 14:49.105
How was the follow-up? Everything okay?

197
14:49.185 --> 14:50.145
No problems.

198
14:50.225 --> 14:54.345
I'll go tomorrow to fill out my paperwork. I'll be able to take classes again soon.

199
14:55.105 --> 14:55.945
That's great.

200
14:59.705 --> 15:00.585
How's that?

201
15:01.625 --> 15:02.465
Not bad, right?

202
15:03.305 --> 15:04.425
Wash up for dinner.

203
15:07.705 --> 15:08.745
Let's eat.

204
15:09.985 --> 15:11.985
Eat some vegetables.

205
15:12.065 --> 15:13.545
Thank you, Ms. Zhou.

206
15:17.105 --> 15:20.865
Dad, you've already read every word of my lab results.

207
15:20.945 --> 15:22.065
All right, okay.

208
15:23.865 --> 15:25.945
Are you in Yanan's classes this semester?

209
15:27.505 --> 15:31.385
I'm retaking the immunology class because of my medical leave last year.

210
15:32.545 --> 15:36.465
I'm glad your mom's childhood friend can watch over you.

211
15:36.545 --> 15:37.705
Watch over me?

212
15:38.305 --> 15:39.745
Then remember to pay him.

213
15:41.345 --> 15:43.465
Right, speaking of which, that reminds me.

214
15:44.985 --> 15:47.465
Give this to him for me.

215
15:47.545 --> 15:50.385
Write some auspicious words on it as well.

216
15:52.105 --> 15:53.025
I was kidding.

217
15:54.305 --> 15:55.345
No.

218
15:56.025 --> 15:58.305
He just moved. It's a housewarming gift.

219
16:04.385 --> 16:05.665
HAPPY HOUSEWARMING

220
16:05.745 --> 16:07.625
Ms. Zhou asked me to give this to you.

221
16:15.425 --> 16:16.625
Did you write this?

222
16:16.705 --> 16:17.545
Obviously.

223
16:18.145 --> 16:19.345
The ink just dried.

224
16:20.385 --> 16:22.585
Pretty nice Zhao-style calligraphy.

225
16:22.665 --> 16:23.865
I'll take it.

226
16:23.945 --> 16:25.185
However,

227
16:25.985 --> 16:27.425
she and I are old friends.

228
16:27.505 --> 16:29.145
She didn't have to give money.

229
16:29.705 --> 16:32.025
Besides, she isn't coming to the housewarming.

230
16:32.105 --> 16:33.545
A gift isn't necessary.

231
16:34.265 --> 16:35.105
Accept it.

232
16:36.705 --> 16:38.185
YOU RECEIVED 1,000 YUAN

233
16:38.985 --> 16:41.745
This gifting back and forth only troubles me.

234
16:42.345 --> 16:43.545
All right.

235
16:43.625 --> 16:44.825
It's exam time. Go.

236
16:46.025 --> 16:49.185
You're lucky to make it in time for my in-class exam.

237
16:49.265 --> 16:51.665
This is counted towards the regular grade.

238
16:52.905 --> 16:54.585
If I do well on this exam,

239
16:54.665 --> 16:56.865
give me the key to the old lab.

240
16:56.945 --> 16:59.025
I live off-campus. I need a place to study.

241
16:59.745 --> 17:00.945
I knew it.

242
17:01.025 --> 17:02.545
A housewarming gift?

243
17:02.625 --> 17:04.825
There was an ulterior motive.

244
17:12.224 --> 17:13.665
Before we begin today's exam,

245
17:13.745 --> 17:15.785
I want to introduce someone new.

246
17:16.424 --> 17:17.265
Chen Yanzhou.

247
17:17.345 --> 17:19.224
He's a year older than you.

248
17:19.305 --> 17:22.145
He took a year off for medical reasons.

249
17:22.224 --> 17:24.424
Starting today, he is joining Class 1.

250
17:24.505 --> 17:27.745
I'm sure you will have many classes together,

251
17:27.825 --> 17:30.305
so please get along well.

252
17:32.905 --> 17:34.105
You can sit over there.

253
17:35.345 --> 17:36.625
Zheng Yu.

254
17:36.705 --> 17:37.585
Here.

255
17:52.465 --> 17:53.625
Zheng Yu.

256
17:54.225 --> 17:56.305
You don't have a lab partner this semester, right?

257
17:56.385 --> 17:58.305
You and Chen Yanzhou will be partners.

258
18:02.465 --> 18:03.745
Okay, put everything away.

259
18:03.825 --> 18:05.025
Get ready for the exam.

260
18:23.785 --> 18:24.865
Hey.

261
18:26.505 --> 18:28.865
Find a reason to give Mr. Li.

262
18:28.945 --> 18:31.065
Any reason. Just don't be my partner.

263
18:33.905 --> 18:36.385
-What do you mean? -Weren't you away for a year?

264
18:36.985 --> 18:39.505
I don't have time to help you catch up.

265
18:42.065 --> 18:44.145
In that case, why did you agree earlier?

266
18:44.945 --> 18:47.305
You get to be the good guy, and I'm the bad guy.

267
18:48.265 --> 18:51.905
I didn't want to reject you and embarrass you in front of everyone.

268
18:55.425 --> 18:56.385
Should I thank you?

269
18:56.985 --> 18:58.145
No need.

270
18:58.225 --> 19:00.585
You can tell Mr. Li that I'm the problem.

271
19:01.185 --> 19:02.465
I have better things to do.

272
19:19.585 --> 19:21.145
Cutting it close again.

273
19:23.025 --> 19:24.665
Do kids nowadays refuse to give

274
19:24.745 --> 19:27.185
even an extra minute of their lives to work?

275
19:31.025 --> 19:32.545
Who is the boss here?

276
19:34.065 --> 19:36.065
Hurry up and ring them up.

277
19:40.705 --> 19:42.505
When are you going to pay me for the perfume?

278
19:42.585 --> 19:43.505
It's been days.

279
19:45.185 --> 19:47.185
When I get the Vitality Award.

280
19:47.945 --> 19:49.465
The Vitality Award?

281
19:50.145 --> 19:53.145
Only the top student in each major can get it.

282
19:53.905 --> 19:56.305
Can you be 100% certain you can get it?

283
19:56.385 --> 19:57.985
I got it for the past two years.

284
19:58.065 --> 20:00.505
It shouldn't be a problem this year.

285
20:01.905 --> 20:03.465
Cash or scan to pay?

286
20:08.705 --> 20:09.545
Fine.

287
20:09.625 --> 20:10.865
It's just a few months.

288
20:11.465 --> 20:12.785
Even if you don't get it,

289
20:13.385 --> 20:15.625
the general scholarship is more than enough.

290
20:16.425 --> 20:17.265
I have a request.

291
20:17.865 --> 20:20.145
I want your help on my elective assignments

292
20:20.225 --> 20:21.065
as interest.

293
20:22.945 --> 20:23.785
Fine.

294
21:07.745 --> 21:08.625
Paying in cash.

295
21:11.665 --> 21:12.945
A total of 66 yuan.

296
21:24.145 --> 21:25.425
So much for being

297
21:26.385 --> 21:27.985
a Vitality Award recipient.

298
21:42.545 --> 21:44.105
Your time doesn't seem

299
21:44.745 --> 21:46.225
as valuable as you say.

300
22:49.225 --> 22:50.625
One just-expired rice ball.

301
22:51.145 --> 22:52.665
Two just-expired boxed meals.

302
22:54.065 --> 22:56.305
LU SIQUAN

303
23:13.625 --> 23:15.905
"Just expired"? Those expired four hours ago!

304
23:16.505 --> 23:17.625
Toss them earlier.

305
23:17.705 --> 23:19.985
Don't wait until it's night to slowly check them.

306
24:00.585 --> 24:01.425
Thank you.

307
24:02.185 --> 24:03.545
Zheng Yu, you're back.

308
24:03.625 --> 24:05.985
These are the new roommates I told you about.

309
24:06.065 --> 24:08.865
They moved from the fifth floor and are in Class 2.

310
24:09.785 --> 24:11.265
This is Liu Linlin.

311
24:11.345 --> 24:12.185
Hello.

312
24:12.265 --> 24:13.945
We're in many classes together.

313
24:15.505 --> 24:16.345
This is Xu--

314
24:16.425 --> 24:17.625
I'm Xu Fangli.

315
24:17.705 --> 24:20.025
Is your WeChat profile picture blank?

316
24:20.105 --> 24:21.745
Do you know each other?

317
24:22.345 --> 24:23.905
She's helped me with errands.

318
24:24.745 --> 24:27.825
You always collected the luggage I had sent over each semester.

319
24:28.505 --> 24:30.465
You did it even without an elevator.

320
24:30.545 --> 24:32.345
It was a paid service, not a favor to thank me for.

321
24:32.985 --> 24:33.905
Why not?

322
24:33.985 --> 24:37.185
Without you, I don't know how I would've managed.

323
24:37.785 --> 24:39.745
Couldn't you just bring it with you?

324
24:39.825 --> 24:41.385
Why did it have to be sent?

325
24:41.465 --> 24:43.465
Traveling with luggage is such a hassle.

326
24:44.065 --> 24:45.305
Best to travel light.

327
24:45.905 --> 24:47.585
Even a big handbag is too much.

328
24:51.825 --> 24:53.225
Is our stuff in your way?

329
24:54.225 --> 24:56.785
We heard two of your roommates moved off-campus,

330
24:56.865 --> 24:58.505
so we applied to move down here.

331
24:58.585 --> 24:59.985
I can't believe you're here.

332
25:00.065 --> 25:02.105
It's good to see a familiar face.

333
25:03.825 --> 25:04.945
Sorry.

334
25:05.025 --> 25:07.905
Your desk was empty, so I borrowed it for a bit.

335
25:07.985 --> 25:08.825
Thank you.

336
25:10.785 --> 25:11.785
Thank you.

337
25:11.865 --> 25:13.665
One, two, three, go.

338
25:19.385 --> 25:20.425
Had a light dinner?

339
25:21.225 --> 25:22.905
No, I didn't even eat.

340
25:23.505 --> 25:24.945
I thought of it as dieting.

341
25:25.025 --> 25:28.065
I didn't expect this bit of work to use up so much energy.

342
25:28.865 --> 25:29.705
This…

343
25:31.025 --> 25:32.185
At this hour,

344
25:32.265 --> 25:33.505
the doors will be closed.

345
25:35.545 --> 25:38.105
It's fine. Missing one meal won't kill me.

346
25:51.585 --> 25:52.745
Zheng Yu,

347
25:52.825 --> 25:54.905
can you sell your other meal to me?

348
25:54.985 --> 25:57.345
I can treat you to anything you want tomorrow.

349
26:07.385 --> 26:08.265
Sorry.

350
26:08.825 --> 26:10.665
This is my breakfast for tomorrow.

351
26:14.825 --> 26:17.185
It's okay. I guess it will help me lose some weight.

352
26:29.465 --> 26:31.225
Today's practical lab has one goal.

353
26:31.305 --> 26:33.585
That is to make target bands visible.

354
26:33.665 --> 26:34.625
Remember.

355
26:34.705 --> 26:37.185
Adhering to safety protocols and careful execution

356
26:37.265 --> 26:40.145
are the sole prerequisites for achieving visible bands.

357
26:46.745 --> 26:49.345
Let me also mention the competition.

358
26:49.425 --> 26:50.265
This semester,

359
26:50.345 --> 26:53.625
we'll be having the Excellence Cup College Student Life Sciences Competition.

360
26:53.705 --> 26:55.865
Why am I making you do experiments in teams?

361
26:55.945 --> 26:57.505
It's so you learn to get along.

362
26:58.265 --> 26:59.145
Now,

363
26:59.225 --> 27:01.865
there are two months until the registration deadline.

364
27:01.945 --> 27:02.785
So

365
27:03.865 --> 27:04.905
team up early

366
27:05.585 --> 27:06.985
and prepare in advance.

367
27:10.505 --> 27:11.625
Team up.

368
27:22.025 --> 27:24.865
Didn't I tell you two to partner up?

369
27:24.945 --> 27:25.785
What's going on?

370
27:30.505 --> 27:31.865
I think going solo is fine.

371
27:31.945 --> 27:34.265
The concept of teamwork is a hoax.

372
27:34.345 --> 27:37.385
A team of two people at different levels

373
27:37.465 --> 27:39.265
receives the same score.

374
27:39.785 --> 27:41.745
Only the one with lower grades

375
27:42.265 --> 27:43.905
would find it fair.

376
27:45.225 --> 27:47.025
You two haven't teamed up before.

377
27:47.105 --> 27:49.345
I have partnered with others before.

378
27:49.985 --> 27:51.545
But every time,

379
27:52.145 --> 27:53.185
my partner

380
27:53.865 --> 27:54.905
was a burden to me.

381
27:58.745 --> 28:00.145
Actually, Chen Yanzhou--

382
28:00.225 --> 28:01.225
I agree.

383
28:01.305 --> 28:02.225
Sir,

384
28:02.825 --> 28:05.225
I took a break from my studies for a year.

385
28:05.305 --> 28:07.305
I don't want to hold others back.

386
28:10.305 --> 28:11.705
Since we are in agreement,

387
28:11.785 --> 28:12.745
this talk is over.

388
28:13.425 --> 28:16.305
Sir, I'm busy. I have to go.

389
28:23.905 --> 28:24.945
Hold others back?

390
28:25.865 --> 28:29.465
Before you took time off, you were already studying third-year courses.

391
28:29.545 --> 28:31.545
You kept up your studies while away.

392
28:32.465 --> 28:33.865
You didn't tell Zheng Yu.

393
28:34.505 --> 28:36.025
What would I tell her?

394
28:36.105 --> 28:39.345
That I might not be the one on a lower level?

395
28:41.025 --> 28:44.185
Not only are you healthier, but your words have become harsher.

396
28:44.265 --> 28:46.265
So you agree it's harsh.

397
28:46.345 --> 28:47.265
I just copied her.

398
28:50.305 --> 28:52.905
Give the Excellence Cup some thought.

399
28:54.145 --> 28:56.025
Zheng Yu is a good choice.

400
28:56.105 --> 28:58.265
She's a two-year Vitality Award recipient.

401
28:58.345 --> 29:00.985
It's just that you don't know her well.

402
29:02.145 --> 29:03.545
I do know her.

403
29:03.625 --> 29:04.825
You do?

404
29:06.945 --> 29:10.145
I recently learned that some people use their scholarship

405
29:10.225 --> 29:11.465
like a credit card

406
29:12.105 --> 29:13.305
to buy now, pay later.

407
29:26.665 --> 29:27.545
Hello.

408
29:27.625 --> 29:31.465
-Do you have this brand of beef? -Let me see.

409
29:32.625 --> 29:33.905
It should be sold out.

410
29:33.985 --> 29:36.145
I'll check out the back. There might be some.

411
29:36.745 --> 29:37.585
Okay.

412
29:39.025 --> 29:41.545
Ms. Zhou, I'm at the supermarket.

413
29:41.625 --> 29:43.305
Is there anything you need?

414
29:43.385 --> 29:46.145
I thought you were going to the lab tonight.

415
29:46.225 --> 29:47.465
Dad is working late.

416
29:47.545 --> 29:51.505
Having dinner with you is more important than doing experiments.

417
30:12.545 --> 30:13.705
Hello, miss.

418
30:14.545 --> 30:16.305
We're out of the imported beef.

419
30:16.385 --> 30:18.905
This is similar in cost and quality. Is that okay?

420
30:18.985 --> 30:20.305
Okay, I'll take it.

421
30:30.425 --> 30:31.265
I'm in a hurry.

422
30:32.185 --> 30:33.345
What's your point?

423
30:37.705 --> 30:39.465
Item successful.

424
30:40.025 --> 30:41.745
That's 1,321 yuan.

425
30:42.545 --> 30:44.305
Here's your receipt. Take it.

426
30:49.705 --> 30:51.585
She doesn't look short on cash.

427
31:10.065 --> 31:12.905
Don't get my imported rug dirty,

428
31:12.985 --> 31:14.825
or you'll have to pay in US dollars.

429
31:15.585 --> 31:16.665
Shoes.

430
31:33.025 --> 31:35.225
Why are you putting it there? Put it on the counter.

431
31:37.985 --> 31:40.185
I've been calling you for ages, but you didn't answer.

432
31:40.265 --> 31:43.785
My son's tutoring lesson was supposed to start 15 minutes ago.

433
31:43.865 --> 31:46.505
Due to your poor time management,

434
31:46.585 --> 31:49.185
my son's bedtime will have to be pushed back 15 minutes.

435
31:50.905 --> 31:52.265
The total is 1,321 yuan.

436
31:52.345 --> 31:54.585
You sent 1,300 yuan, 21 yuan short.

437
31:58.825 --> 32:01.225
Who told you to buy this brand of beef?

438
32:01.305 --> 32:04.625
You're a college student, and you can't even do this correctly.

439
32:04.705 --> 32:07.185
You can exchange it at the store with the receipt.

440
32:08.465 --> 32:09.425
What a hassle.

441
32:10.225 --> 32:12.505
You're right that it is a hassle.

442
32:12.585 --> 32:14.145
If you need errands done,

443
32:14.225 --> 32:16.065
please pay the errand fee in advance.

444
32:16.145 --> 32:19.865
It's now 20 minutes past the original tutoring start time.

445
32:19.945 --> 32:23.385
I will go start the lesson now so your son doesn't stay up all night.

446
32:24.705 --> 32:25.545
You…

447
32:31.905 --> 32:34.385
Ms. Zheng, do you hate my mom?

448
32:35.665 --> 32:36.625
I don't love her.

449
32:37.345 --> 32:40.585
Then why don't you just tutor somewhere else?

450
32:41.345 --> 32:43.025
Your house is close to the campus.

451
32:45.105 --> 32:48.665
Aren't you afraid she will fire you if you treat her like that?

452
32:49.825 --> 32:50.665
What have I done?

453
32:52.185 --> 32:54.545
Talked back to her. Defied her.

454
32:54.625 --> 32:56.385
For the amount she pays me,

455
32:56.465 --> 32:57.705
she probably can't find

456
32:57.785 --> 33:00.225
another college student tutor offering better value.

457
33:00.305 --> 33:03.105
I have the grades and ranking she likes.

458
33:03.185 --> 33:05.505
EXAM SCORE: 95, NAME: ZHENG YU, RANK: SECOND

459
33:07.385 --> 33:09.225
Couldn't Yanan give me another point?

460
33:09.305 --> 33:10.585
Make it an even number.

461
33:11.105 --> 33:13.145
You think you're haggling for groceries?

462
33:13.225 --> 33:16.145
Say, I crammed day and night,

463
33:16.225 --> 33:17.665
and this is all I got.

464
33:17.745 --> 33:21.265
This Chen Yanzhou took nearly a year off.

465
33:21.345 --> 33:23.025
His grades aren't affected at all.

466
33:23.105 --> 33:26.585
I heard from an upperclassman that their student year has a saying.

467
33:26.665 --> 33:29.145
There's no first place that Chen Yanzhou can't get.

468
33:29.225 --> 33:30.945
Unless he doesn't participate.

469
33:31.025 --> 33:32.305
-Yeah, right. -It's true.

470
33:32.985 --> 33:34.865
He got into Cheng Xiulin's lab in his freshman year.

471
33:34.945 --> 33:38.985
It seems that he later had to withdraw due to medical reasons.

472
33:39.585 --> 33:40.745
He's a serious student.

473
33:41.665 --> 33:43.425
He always got the Vitality Award.

474
33:44.305 --> 33:46.065
NAME: ZHENG YU, RANK: SECOND

475
33:52.945 --> 33:55.385
Last week, you paid 2,000 yuan just in time.

476
33:55.465 --> 33:57.145
But this won't last long.

477
33:57.225 --> 33:59.305
Can you come up with another solution?

478
34:06.105 --> 34:07.065
Geez.

479
34:07.665 --> 34:09.425
Where are you going? Class is starting.

480
34:11.105 --> 34:12.225
In a bad mood?

481
34:19.025 --> 34:21.065
"Where are you going? Class is starting."

482
34:22.945 --> 34:24.264
It's been three years.

483
34:24.344 --> 34:25.665
You still like Zheng Yu?

484
34:26.344 --> 34:27.985
He's a hopeless romantic.

485
34:43.025 --> 34:44.824
Before the immunology exam,

486
34:44.905 --> 34:47.065
I saw that repeat student give a red packet

487
34:47.145 --> 34:48.505
to Li Yanan.

488
35:08.345 --> 35:09.625
After class,

489
35:10.945 --> 35:11.945
let's talk.

490
35:24.745 --> 35:26.985
You don't want to sit at the same table as me,

491
35:27.065 --> 35:28.545
so just get to the point.

492
35:31.265 --> 35:32.945
Before the immunology exam,

493
35:33.025 --> 35:34.905
you gave Mr. Li a red packet.

494
35:42.505 --> 35:43.345
Who said that?

495
35:43.425 --> 35:44.865
It doesn't matter.

496
35:47.825 --> 35:49.065
Most people who hear that

497
35:49.745 --> 35:53.225
would gossip behind my back or directly report me.

498
35:54.025 --> 35:56.425
I've never met someone like you.

499
35:56.945 --> 35:58.105
I thought about it.

500
35:58.185 --> 36:01.345
Mr. Li doesn't seem like the type to accept bribes.

501
36:01.945 --> 36:04.105
I don't want to arbitrarily gossip or report

502
36:04.185 --> 36:06.465
and cause harm to a responsible teacher.

503
36:07.065 --> 36:09.065
But nothing is absolute.

504
36:10.105 --> 36:11.545
So I wanted to ask you.

505
36:12.265 --> 36:13.585
I want to confirm,

506
36:13.665 --> 36:15.105
at least in this matter,

507
36:16.025 --> 36:17.025
that all was fair.

508
36:20.345 --> 36:22.105
What if it was unfair

509
36:22.185 --> 36:23.625
and I did give it to him?

510
36:25.345 --> 36:26.505
What will you do?

511
36:30.105 --> 36:32.225
Well, I don't want you to be unaware,

512
36:32.305 --> 36:34.785
walking around the campus without a care.

513
36:35.425 --> 36:38.825
I have to at least let you know that I know what you did.

514
36:41.105 --> 36:43.225
"I know what you did."

515
36:44.625 --> 36:46.185
That should be my sentence.

516
36:47.505 --> 36:50.065
Li Yanan never received my money.

517
36:50.145 --> 36:51.305
Did you forget?

518
36:52.425 --> 36:53.865
The one who got money from me

519
36:53.945 --> 36:55.065
was you.

520
36:55.905 --> 36:57.585
I never got the chance to ask you.

521
36:58.185 --> 36:59.745
How did you find my wallet?

522
36:59.825 --> 37:01.825
If there hadn't been a lost-and-found notice

523
37:01.905 --> 37:04.145
when you found my wallet,

524
37:04.225 --> 37:07.305
what price would you have demanded?

525
37:20.785 --> 37:21.905
JOB RATES SEND?

526
37:24.865 --> 37:27.385
COLLEGE OF FOREIGN LANGUAGES QIAN YIWEN, 500 YUAN

527
37:27.465 --> 37:28.545
ACCEPT?

528
37:28.625 --> 37:29.945
LOADING

529
37:30.465 --> 37:31.305
QIAN YIWEN

530
37:31.385 --> 37:33.545
Have you chosen football for your PE class?

531
37:34.145 --> 37:36.385
Does the football instructor know you?

532
37:36.985 --> 37:38.625
No, he doesn't.

533
37:41.505 --> 37:42.865
Welcome.

534
37:46.585 --> 37:47.625
Great!

535
37:48.745 --> 37:49.905
Shi Yinjie.

536
37:49.985 --> 37:50.825
Here.

537
37:51.545 --> 37:53.385
-Shen Lei. -Here.

538
37:53.465 --> 37:54.545
Qian Yiwen.

539
37:56.025 --> 37:57.225
Qian Yiwen!

540
37:59.465 --> 38:00.625
Zhong Qiu.

541
38:02.465 --> 38:03.585
All right.

542
38:03.665 --> 38:04.985
Next, for this class--

543
38:05.065 --> 38:05.905
Sir.

544
38:06.585 --> 38:09.385
My name wasn't called. I applied for the class last week.

545
38:10.065 --> 38:11.385
What is your name?

546
38:11.465 --> 38:12.465
Chen Yanzhou.

547
38:13.065 --> 38:14.065
I didn't receive it.

548
38:14.665 --> 38:16.385
You can follow along.

549
38:16.465 --> 38:18.545
Get this sorted after class.

550
38:20.345 --> 38:21.705
-Next, let's-- -Sir!

551
38:25.825 --> 38:27.185
I'm Qian Yiwen.

552
38:29.105 --> 38:30.265
Fall in quickly.

553
38:33.825 --> 38:34.865
I remember you were

554
38:35.465 --> 38:37.065
nearly late last time too.

555
38:38.585 --> 38:39.425
Yes.

556
38:40.145 --> 38:41.305
Don't do it again.

557
38:41.385 --> 38:42.745
If you do it again,

558
38:42.825 --> 38:44.105
you will be marked tardy.

559
38:45.705 --> 38:47.585
Don't assume I don't know who you are.

560
38:48.185 --> 38:49.985
I'm keeping tabs on each of you.

561
38:52.705 --> 38:53.825
QIAN YIWEN

562
38:53.905 --> 38:55.065
Fall in.

563
38:55.825 --> 38:57.865
Okay, go to the field.

564
38:58.465 --> 39:01.905
For this class, practice with a partner what you learned last time,

565
39:01.985 --> 39:04.305
kicking the ball with the inside of your foot.

566
39:04.385 --> 39:05.745
Practice for 20 minutes.

567
39:05.825 --> 39:07.865
After that, we'll learn something new.

568
39:07.945 --> 39:09.345
Okay, get to it.

569
39:16.105 --> 39:18.065
Who is your football partner?

570
39:18.145 --> 39:19.585
I'm solo right now.

571
39:19.665 --> 39:22.425
If this keeps up, the instructor will eventually notice.

572
39:22.505 --> 39:24.345
We'll be in trouble.

573
39:24.945 --> 39:26.025
Got it? Like that.

574
39:26.105 --> 39:27.425
The top of the foot.

575
39:28.865 --> 39:32.065
I forgot to tell you. My partner also cut class today.

576
39:32.665 --> 39:34.985
Why don't you just pick someone there?

577
39:35.585 --> 39:37.065
Extra charge.

578
39:39.025 --> 39:40.225
Again.

579
39:41.265 --> 39:42.385
Get it this time.

580
39:47.985 --> 39:49.065
Hey there!

581
39:55.465 --> 39:56.945
Hey, are you okay?

582
39:57.025 --> 39:57.865
It's an accident.

583
40:03.425 --> 40:06.345
I wanted to ask you if you wanted to practice together.

584
40:07.545 --> 40:08.585
No.

585
40:16.425 --> 40:17.505
How are you? Okay?

586
40:19.785 --> 40:22.305
Hey, I can take you to the infirmary

587
40:22.385 --> 40:23.505
if you're not okay.

588
40:30.705 --> 40:32.345
-It's not serious. -Good.

589
40:32.425 --> 40:33.985
Be careful during practice.

590
40:34.065 --> 40:35.065
Okay.

591
40:48.985 --> 40:50.705
Why are you following me?

592
40:50.785 --> 40:53.185
This class isn't over. I have to stay with you.

593
40:55.025 --> 40:55.865
Hit me back.

594
40:55.945 --> 40:57.465
I won't dodge.

595
40:57.545 --> 40:58.825
Afterward, let's practice.

596
40:59.425 --> 41:02.385
This teacher is very strict about substitutes.

597
41:02.465 --> 41:04.625
If I'm caught, I will be in big trouble.

598
41:06.465 --> 41:08.825
Afraid your Vitality Award will slip away?

599
41:09.625 --> 41:11.345
No, it's not that serious.

600
41:12.745 --> 41:13.705
What now, then?

601
41:43.065 --> 41:44.505
What are you waiting for?

602
41:44.585 --> 41:45.785
Get the ball.

603
42:02.305 --> 42:05.345
You two were recipients of the Vitality Award in past years.

604
42:05.425 --> 42:07.705
First, thank you for accepting this interview.

605
42:07.785 --> 42:10.185
Next, I will be asking you some questions.

606
42:10.265 --> 42:12.945
First, what does this award mean to you?

607
42:13.025 --> 42:14.105
-Money. -Money.

608
42:16.145 --> 42:17.425
Do you need money too?

609
42:18.025 --> 42:19.225
No.

610
42:19.305 --> 42:21.225
Then why did you say money?

611
42:21.865 --> 42:23.425
Because it is money.

612
42:27.945 --> 42:30.625
How did you feel when you received the award?

613
42:30.705 --> 42:31.585
-Relief. -Relief.

614
42:38.625 --> 42:41.785
What would you want to do if you had no worries?

615
42:41.865 --> 42:43.465
-Nothing at all. -Nothing at all.

616
42:47.225 --> 42:48.185
Sorry,

617
42:48.265 --> 42:50.465
I'm going to ask an unrelated question.

618
42:50.545 --> 42:51.505
Are you acquainted?

619
42:52.185 --> 42:53.265
-No. -No.

620
43:03.145 --> 43:04.665
I said I didn't know him,

621
43:04.745 --> 43:06.665
and he said he didn't know me.

622
43:06.745 --> 43:07.585
It's true.

623
43:08.585 --> 43:11.665
We had met only a few times at the hospital and in class.

624
43:12.505 --> 43:14.545
But sitting there that day,

625
43:15.065 --> 43:17.225
we seemed like we had rehearsed our answers.
